{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41580","headline":"秋日 · 沈彬","name":"秋日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋含砧杵捣斜阳，笛引西风颢气凉。\n薜荔惹烟笼蟋蟀，芰荷翻雨泼鸳鸯。\n当年酒贱何妨醉，今日时难不易狂。\n肠断旧游从一别，潘安惆怅满头霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈彬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41580.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41580","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}